    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mumpulilize inywe abataho amani kuba bagorogoki, mumpulilize inywe abaitanira Omukama. Mwijuke orwazi orwo mwatemirweho, mwijuke ekiina ky'amabare ekyo mwashokoirwemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwijuke Aburahamu isheinywe, mwijuke na Sara ayabazaire. Kuba Aburahamu nkamweta akyali mumoi; kyonkai kanamuhaire omugisha, mbwenu leba abaijukuru muli bangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama naija kumaramara Sioni, amaramare n'amatongo gayo. N'orwo ensi eyo Sioni elimu lili irungu, ndigihindura Edeni, eshushe endimiro y'Omukama. Sioni elishemelerwa egire ebyera, esiime nehoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ontege amatwi iwe ihanga lyange, na inywe amahanga mumpulilize. Kuba ninyija kutaho Amateka, n'obugorogoki bwange bube mushana gw'amahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi haihi muno kuboleka okwo ndi mugorogoki, ndi hagufi kubarokora; kandi omu bushobora bwange ndayegesa amahanga obugorogoki. Ensi ezili harai zindindilire, zindindilire n'eshubi kanzirokora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwinunure amaisho muraramire eiguru, mulebe n'ahansi. Eiguru lilihwaho bundi mwika, n'ensi elinyamuka nk'omwendo. Kandi n'abantu omu nsi tulifa nk'enda. Inye ndikara mbarokoire, tindiilekera kubachungura.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mumpulilize inywe abamanya obugorogoki kintuki. Mumpulilize inywe atulikwekomya Amateka gange omu mitima yanyu. Abantu batabajuma mukatina, batabajamya mukahwahwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba enyenje zilibalya nk'emyendo, n'obuhuka bubalye okwo bulya obwoya bw'entaama. Kyonkai inye ndiikara mbarokoire, amakiro gona tindilekera kubachungura.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo muhulire ekigambo eki inywe atuli omu naku, inywe atulikutarambukana oti mutamiire edivai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wanyu, Omukama wanyu alikubatelera omushango nagamba ati, “Ekibonabonyio ekyo nabahaire nigaire leba nakibaihyaho; tinkinigara nkashuba nkababonabonyia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shana mbwenu ndabonabonyia abatura nibababonesa enaku, ababagambiraga bati, ‘Mubyame ahansi tubarabe aha migongo.’ Emigongo yanyu ekaba bulibato, yaba mbarabara ez'okuta nibarabamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
